        "TileImage": "$($repository 1739b757-1ddf-4529-885a-6fe0e6074084).Image",
        "Description": "Ready for your big movie break? Our client specializes in producing snuff films for the dark web. And they have approached us for a collaboration in their next project. It&apos;s called &quot;NOFX: Blood on the Backlot.&quot; \rThe premise is simple, while Dino Bosco works on his masterpiece, we work on our own. Sneak behinds the scenes and take out the targets. Secret cameras will capture your performance. Best of luck to you.",
